<title>USA: TENNIS-MEMPHIS MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MEMPHIS MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tennessee 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$825,000 St Jude men's tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix</p>
<p>number denote seeding)</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Juan Albert Viloca (Spain) beat Sjeng Schalken (Netherlands)</p>
<p>6-4 4-6 6-0</p>
<p>Guillaume Raoux (France) beat Thomas Johansson (Sweden) 6-4</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Richard Fromberg (Australia) beat Patrick McEnroe (U.S.) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-1) 6-3</p>
<p>Jeff Tarango (U.S.) beat Galo Blanco (Spain) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) beat Jonathan Stark (U.S.) 6-7</p>
<p>(1-7) 7-6 (7-4) 6-4</p>
<p>Alex Radulescu (Germany) beat Michael Joyce (U.S.) 7-5 4-6</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat Patrick Rafter (Australia) 6-2</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>8-Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat Sebastien Lareau (Canada)</p>
<p>6-4 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Magnus Norman (Sweden) beat 10-Mark Philippoussis (Australia)</p>
<p>6-4 7-5</p>
<p>15-Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) beat Jacco Eltingh (Netherlands)</p>
<p>7-6 (8-6) 6-3</p>
</text>
